@startuml
title 9.8.7 Training Round Command Creation\nand Global Model Distribution

hide footbox

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #555555
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #333333
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
    DividerBorderColor #777777
    DividerBackgroundColor white
    DividerFontStyle bold
    NoteBorderColor #777777
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDF5
}

legend top left
  i = 1..N (factory index)

  CIN : contentInstance
  Mca : AE-CSE reference point
  Mcc : CSE-CSE reference point
endlegend

box "Factory i" #EAF2FC
participant "MN-AE[i]" as MNAE
participant "MN-CSE[i]" as MNCSE
end box

box "Cloud Service Platform" #FFF8E7
participant "IN-CSE" as INCSE
participant "IN-AE" as INAE
end box


note over INCSE, INAE
The global model metadata referenced by the command
is stored under cnt-global-model.

globalModelUri targets cnt-global-model/la.
end note


== 9.8.7 Training Round Command Creation ==

INAE -> INCSE : CREATE <CIN>\nunder IN-AE/cnt-fl-control\ncon:\ntype = fl-command\njobState = START_ROUND\ncurrentRound = n\nglobalModelUri = /IN-AE/cnt-global-model/la\ntimestamp

INCSE --> INAE : CREATE Response\n2001 CREATED


== Cross-CSE Round Command Notification ==

loop for each factory i = 1..N
    INCSE -> MNCSE : NOTIFY\nNew round-command <CIN>\nTo: MN-AE[i]\njobState = START_ROUND\ncurrentRound = n\nglobalModelUri

    MNCSE -> MNAE : Forward NOTIFY via Mca

    MNAE --> MNCSE : NOTIFY Response\n2000 OK
    MNCSE --> INCSE : Forward NOTIFY Response
end


== Global Model Metadata Retrieval ==

loop for each factory i = 1..N
    MNAE -> MNCSE : RETRIEVE\ntarget = /IN-AE/cnt-global-model/la

    MNCSE -> INCSE : Forward RETRIEVE via Mcc\ntarget = /IN-AE/cnt-global-model/la

    INCSE --> MNCSE : RETRIEVE Response\nglobalRound\nmodelURI\nchecksum\nmodelSize\ntimestamp

    MNCSE --> MNAE : Forward RETRIEVE Response
end


== Global Model Download and Local Cache ==

loop for each factory i = 1..N
    MNAE -> MNAE : Download global model file\nusing modelURI\nVerify checksum

    MNAE -> MNCSE : CREATE <CIN>\nunder MN-AE[i]/cnt-local-model\ncon:\ntype = global-model-cache\nglobalRound = n\nsourceModelURI\nlocalModelURI\nchecksum\ntimestamp

    MNCSE --> MNAE : CREATE Response\n2001 CREATED
end

note over MNAE, INAE
The same notification, retrieval and local-cache procedure
is reused after a START_NEXT_ROUND command in clause 9.8.9.
end note

@enduml